{"after_gate_rev": null, "author_time": 1533406863, "commit": "427f13fcd36bccbbde7bbf56b044dbca2db24b57", "id": "microservices-demo-427f13fcd36b", "issue": {"body": "**Build error for Go microservices, OpenConcensus Stackdriver exporter moved to different repo**\nWhen i try to build all images from source code with Skaffold, i got the following error:\n\n`package go.opencensus.io/exporter/stackdriver: no Go files in /go/src/go.opencensus.io/exporter/stackdriver`\n\nI investigated about the openconcensus exporters, i realized that they moved community exporters to \ncontrib.go.opencensus.io subdomain. So to build Go microservices successfully, change the Docker files and .go files that uses stackdriver exporters.\n\nChanges in Dockerfile:\n\nfrom \n\n```\nRUN go get -d golang.org/x/net/context \\\n ...\\\n  go.opencensus.io/exporter/stackdriver \\\n...\n```\n\nto \n\n```\nRUN go get -d golang.org/x/net/context \\\n...\\\n  contrib.go.opencensus.io/exporter/stackdriver \\\n...\n\n```\n\nChanges in .go files:\n\nfrom \n`\"go.opencensus.io/exporter/stackdriver\"`\n\nto\n`\"contrib.go.opencensus.io/exporter/stackdriver\"`\n", "number": 11, "title": "Go Microservices Build Error: OpenConcensus Stackdriver Exporter Moved to New Repo"}, "issue_fetch": "ok", "parent": "c7dd0cbf318793c7675626fb4596a80fc87ae353", "pr": null, "probe": {}, "prompt_subject": "Resolve the GitHub issue below.", "repo": "microservices-demo", "shape": "symptom", "stats": {"code_files": 9, "code_lines": 31, "test_files": 4}, "subject": "go: use dep in builds, remove relative imports", "truth": {"code": [{"hunks": [[23, 1], [25, 1], [41, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "src/cartservice/probe/main.go", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[25, 0], [27, 1], [34, 2]], "old_path": null, "path": "src/checkoutservice/main.go", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[20, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "src/checkoutservice/money/money.go", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[19, 1], [30, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "src/frontend/handlers.go", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[24, 0], [28, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "src/frontend/main.go", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[19, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "src/frontend/money/money.go", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[20, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "src/frontend/rpc.go", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[28, 1], [30, 0], [32, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "src/productcatalogservice/server.go", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[25, 1], [32, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "src/shippingservice/main.go", "status": "M"}], "other": ["src/cartservice/Dockerfile", "src/cartservice/probe/.dockerignore", "src/cartservice/probe/Gopkg.lock", "src/cartservice/probe/Gopkg.toml", "src/checkoutservice/.dockerignore", "src/checkoutservice/Dockerfile", "src/checkoutservice/Gopkg.lock", "src/checkoutservice/Gopkg.toml", "src/checkoutservice/README.md", "src/frontend/Dockerfile", "src/frontend/Gopkg.lock", "src/frontend/Gopkg.toml", "src/frontend/README.md", "src/productcatalogservice/.dockerignore", "src/productcatalogservice/Dockerfile", "src/productcatalogservice/Gopkg.lock", "src/productcatalogservice/Gopkg.toml", "src/productcatalogservice/README.md", "src/shippingservice/.dockerignore", "src/shippingservice/Dockerfile", "src/shippingservice/Gopkg.lock", "src/shippingservice/Gopkg.toml", "src/shippingservice/README.md"], "tests": ["src/checkoutservice/money/money_test.go", "src/frontend/money/money_test.go", "src/productcatalogservice/server_test.go", "src/shippingservice/shippingservice_test.go"]}}
